# Divided power rings (Stacks, Divided Power Algebra)

This file re-exports the development of divided power rings:

* `StacksFrontier.RingTheory.DividedPowers.Ring.Basic` — the category of divided power rings, its
  limits, and corepresentability of limit-preserving functors with a bounded solution set;
* `StacksFrontier.RingTheory.DividedPowers.Ring.PushoutTensor` — the divided power image of two
  morphisms, and the tensor product of the underlying rings of a pushout;
* `StacksFrontier.RingTheory.DividedPowers.Ring.Colimits` — existence of colimits;
* `StacksFrontier.RingTheory.DividedPowers.Ring.PushoutQuotient` — the quotient of a pushout by its
  distinguished ideal.
